      "rationale": "A strong grouping axis for market-expansion analysis with good spread across verticals. Mostly well-grounded (consumer_tech for 23andme, fintech for Addepar, life_sciences for 5AM Ventures). However the Accel row is labeled 'life_sciences' despite a generic 'exceptional founders' description with no sector signal, showing some unwarranted specificity."
